{"scene_description":"The image depicts the interior of a convenience store. The entrance is visible, with double glass doors and a green exit sign above them. Inside, there are shelves stocked with various products such as milk cartons, juice boxes, and other beverages. A red trash can is located near the entrance. Outside the store, there is a bench and some trees, indicating that it's likely in an outdoor shopping area or plaza. The lighting inside the store appears to be bright, and the overall atmosphere seems clean and well-maintained."}

{"objects":[{"id":1,"label":"double glass doors","observation":"The entrance to the convenience store has two glass doors with metal handles. They are closed and have a green exit sign above them. The doors are framed by white walls and there is a red trash can next to them."},{"id":2,"label":"shelves with products","observation":"Inside the store, there are several shelves filled with various products such as milk cartons, juice boxes, and other beverages. The shelves are white and appear to be made of metal. Some products are packaged in colorful containers."},{"id":3,"label":"bench outside store","observation":"Outside the store, there is a wooden bench with a red cushion. It is located on a paved area with some trees in the background. The bench is empty and appears to be in good condition."},{"id":4,"label":"trash can","observation":"Next to the entrance of the convenience store, there is a red trash can. It is cylindrical and appears to be made of plastic. The trash can is partially visible and has a lid on top."}]}

